Cell Biochem</source><year>2006</year><volume>97</volume><fpage>1036</fpage><lpage>1051</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Cell Biochem||97|1036||bib13|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16294321</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Derynck</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Akhurst</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Balmain</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>TGF-beta signaling in tumor suppression and cancer progression</article-title><source>Nat Genet</source><year>2001</year><volume>29</volume><fpage>117</fpage><lpage>129</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Nat Genet||29|117||bib14|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11586292</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Desruisseau</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Palmari</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Giusti</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Romain</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Martin</surname><given-names>PM</given-names></name><name><surname>Berthois</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Determination of TGFbeta1 protein level in human primary breast cancers and its relationship with survival</article-title><source>Br J Cancer</source><year>2006</year><volume>94</volume><fpage>239</fpage><lpage>246</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Br J Cancer||94|239||bib15|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16404434</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dwivedi</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Pino</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Banh</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><su